' Aus test_multi_dim.py uebertragen (16 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-07). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== multi dim treewalker[DIM a, b, c AS INTEGER\na = 1\nb = 2\nc = 3\nPRINT a + b + c\n-6\n]
DIM a, b, c AS INTEGER
a = 1
b = 2
c = 3
PRINT a + b + c
--- erwartet
6

=== multi dim treewalker[DIM x, y AS STRING\nx = "Hallo"\ny = "Welt"\nPRINT x + " " + y\n-Hallo Welt\n]
DIM x, y AS STRING
x = "Hallo"
y = "Welt"
PRINT x + " " + y
--- erwartet
Hallo Welt

